For whoever keeps the spoiler sheet:

When you are hallucinating and not blind, a potion of invisibility gives
this message:
"Far out, man!  You can see right through yourself!"

I read a scroll of punishment, and got the message "You feel guilty." (and
I got the traditional ball and chain).  According to the spoiler sheet,
this is the message you get when you are confused.  But I wasn't confused
when I read the scroll.
